# Route: guide 5 of 49 of the simulator's completionist route for Troll (1199
# of 1215 eligible quests, 157.3 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 16 to 18, 15
# quests, 1.6 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (The Barrens): The Crossroads -> Far Watch Post -> The Crossroads ->
# Thorn Hill -> Far Watch Post -> Ratchet -> The Merchant Coast -> Ratchet ->
# The Merchant Coast -> Raptor Grounds -> Ratchet -> The Crossroads -> The
# Forgotten Pools -> ….
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 862 Dig Rat
# Stew; 866 Root Samples; 3633 Goblin Engineering; 3637 Gnome Engineering;
# 3646 Membership Card Renewal.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Willix the Importer (1144), Blueleaf Tubers (1221),
# Blueleaf Tubers (1221), Deviate Eradication (1487), Deviate Eradication
# (1487), The Glowing Shard (6981).

